WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.266
Welcome to the Man of Recaps,

00:00:01.266 --> 00:00:06.100
this is Attack on Titan: full series recap before the final part 

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.533
100 years ago, the Titans appeared.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:11.033
They’re naked, creepy looking, man eating giants

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.300
that hunted humans almost to extinction.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.800
But some survivors managed to build enormous walls,

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.733
and the walls work extremely well, they're way taller than any Titan.

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:22.833
So for the last hundred years, humanity's had a relatively peaceful, happy existence.

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:25.800
But some people are not happy, like our main character, Eren Yeager,

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.900
who hates that humanity is penned in here like cattle!

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.066
Eren is a real angry kid who likes to yell a lot.

00:00:31.066 --> 00:00:33.800
His best friend Armin is a smart kid who likes to cry a lot.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.600
And their other best friend Mikasa is the strong silent type who's there to keep Aaron in line.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.433
One day everything changes when a Colossal Titan appears!

00:00:41.433 --> 00:00:43.533
This thing is taller than the walls

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:47.100
and it kicks open the gate, letting the Titans inside.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.433
It is a slaughter.

00:00:48.433 --> 00:00:52.700
And Eren watches as his mom is devoured by a titan.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.933
His hometown of Shiganshina is destroyed, but the interior gate is still intact.

00:00:56.933 --> 00:01:00.833
Until another abnormal Titan appears, this one an Armored Titan.

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:04.833
And oh, it charges the gate, BOOM! Bursts it wide open!

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:08.166
Now the Titans are flooding into Wall Maria, and the entire outer ring,

00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:11.133
the bulk of humanity's land, is lost.

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:12.766
Eren Yeager vows revenge,

00:01:12.766 --> 00:01:16.433
he's going to kill all the Titans, “Every last one!”

00:01:16.433 --> 00:01:18.633
So as soon as he's old enough Eren joins the military,

00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:20.433
along with his best friends Armin and Mikasa.

00:01:20.433 --> 00:01:22.200
And he meets some new best friends among the other recruits.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.533
There's Connie who's bald, Sasha who's hungry,

00:01:24.533 --> 00:01:26.533
and Jean, who's kind of cocky, becomes Eren's rival.

00:01:26.533 --> 00:01:28.833
Now the humans fight Titans in a super cool way,

00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:32.000
using ODM gear, omni directional mobility units,

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.633
that shoot out grappling hooks and let them fly around.

00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:38.266
You got to get up high because the Titans’ only weakness is at the nape of their neck.

00:01:38.266 --> 00:01:40.366
Pretty soon Eren's training is almost complete,

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:44.200
But just then, the Colossal Titan appears again!

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.566
But this time Eren Yeager is ready to fight back.

00:01:46.566 --> 00:01:48.966
He gets up there ready to take this thing out...

00:01:48.966 --> 00:01:51.566
But just as quickly as it appeared, it vanishes!

00:01:51.566 --> 00:01:53.300
What is going on here?

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.933
But before it left, it destroyed the gate

00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:56.633
so now titans are pouring in.

00:01:56.633 --> 00:01:59.800
And it's up to our group of recruits to fight them off!

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.633
It's time for their first epic fight against the Titans, but OH!

00:02:03.633 --> 00:02:06.800
Titans look kind of silly, but they are way faster and stronger.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:09.233
It's not a fight, it's a massacre.

00:02:09.233 --> 00:02:11.400
Armin is about to be eaten - well, there he goes.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:14.566
But oh! Eren grabs him and gets him to safety.

00:02:14.566 --> 00:02:15.933
How is he going to get out of this one?

00:02:15.933 --> 00:02:18.066
Well, he doesn't, he’s swallowed.

00:02:18.066 --> 00:02:19.900
Maybe he's not the main character?

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.800
With Eren out of the picture, his friend Mikasa takes the spotlight.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.766
She is by far the best in the class,

00:02:24.766 --> 00:02:26.366
she's a titan killing natural.

00:02:26.366 --> 00:02:28.166
Until her ODM gear runs out of gas,

00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:29.566
Then things are looking bleak.

00:02:29.566 --> 00:02:32.266
But wait, what's this? One Titan attacks the other!

00:02:32.266 --> 00:02:35.833
And now it's his turn for a Titan killing rampage, all right!

00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:38.266
When he's finally defeated, something very strange happens...

00:02:38.266 --> 00:02:42.100
At the nape of his neck is Eren Yeager!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.200
What is going on?!

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:46.633
It might have something to do with his father, Grisha Yeager,

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:48.633
Who five years ago gave him a mysterious injection

00:02:48.633 --> 00:02:50.600
and the key to his secret basement.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:53.200
But that will remain a mystery for the next 50 episodes.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:56.000
Eren figures out he can transform by drawing blood like biting himself,

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.600
So boom! He's a Titan again!

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.766
He grabs a big old boulder and uses it to plug the gate.

00:03:00.766 --> 00:03:03.233
So this time, humanity has stood its ground!

00:03:03.233 --> 00:03:06.233
So now Eren Yeager is given over to Commander Erwin of the Scout Regiment,

00:03:06.233 --> 00:03:07.900
who’s just a real smart good guy.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:10.833
And once they officially graduate, all of Eren's friends join the Scouts too.

00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:12.933
The strongest of the Scouts is Captain Levi,

00:03:12.933 --> 00:03:15.600
who is an absolute Titan killing machine.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.166
And the smartest of the Scouts is Hanje, who’s the scientist type,

00:03:18.166 --> 00:03:20.666
trying to figure out what Titans even are.

00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:23.833
So pretty soon it's time for their first mission into Titan country.

00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:27.300
But today a new abnormal Titan shows up, the Female Titan!

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:31.100
So now Eren transforms too, and it's a Titan fight!

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.633
But she has the ability to harden certain parts of her body,

00:03:33.633 --> 00:03:35.633
and oh! Beats Eren handily.

00:03:35.633 --> 00:03:37.933
Now one of their friends and fellow recruits is Annie.

00:03:37.933 --> 00:03:39.600
And, I don't want to jump to conclusions,

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:42.000
but she looks exactly like the Female Titan.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.700
They lead her into a trap, but it doesn't work,

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.366
and she transforms again.

00:03:45.366 --> 00:03:48.833
It's Titan Fight round two! And his time Eren takes her down.

00:03:48.833 --> 00:03:50.900
We might finally get some answers.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:54.933
But something unexpected happens, she hardens into a crystal shell.

00:03:54.933 --> 00:03:57.366
And that's where she stays the rest of the series.

00:03:57.366 --> 00:04:00.366
So in season two, Titans appear within the walls!

00:04:00.366 --> 00:04:03.533
But where did they even come from? The walls were not breached.

00:04:03.533 --> 00:04:05.266
But now our gang is surrounded.

00:04:05.266 --> 00:04:07.300
With them this time are Ymir and Christa,

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.433
Ymir's a real tough gal, and Christa’s real nice.

00:04:09.433 --> 00:04:11.033
And Ymir has a huge crush on Christa,

00:04:11.033 --> 00:04:13.366
She's like, “Hey girl, I love ya, sorry about this secret...”

00:04:13.366 --> 00:04:15.966
She leaps off the tower and cuts herself...

00:04:15.966 --> 00:04:19.000
Yes Ymir can turn into a Titan too!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.800
How many people can turn into Titans?!

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:22.866
What is going on?!

00:04:22.866 --> 00:04:25.066
Ymir’s Titan is a weird little gremlin one,

00:04:25.066 --> 00:04:28.433
And when she comes to, hopefully we'll finally get some answers.

00:04:28.433 --> 00:04:30.700
We do solve one mystery of where those Titans came from.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.966
It seems like they started at Connie's hometown, and one of them is still stuck there.

00:04:33.966 --> 00:04:38.600
And there's just no denying it, that Titan is... Connie's mom!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:42.866
Yes it seems that all Titans are people! Blagh!!!

00:04:42.866 --> 00:04:45.233
But how and why was that village transformed?

00:04:45.233 --> 00:04:47.733
Well it might have something to do with the new abnormal they saw.

00:04:47.733 --> 00:04:51.300
They name him the Beast Titan, but he didn't stick around - more on him later.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.133
So now, after their latest brush with death,

00:04:53.133 --> 00:04:54.900
Our one friend Reiner has had enough.

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:57.233
He's like, “Yo Eren, me and Bertholdt are undercover Titans”

00:04:57.233 --> 00:04:58.700
“on a secret mission to capture you,” 

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.900
“so just come with us now and we'll stop all the fighting.”

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.933
Um, wait... What?!

00:05:02.933 --> 00:05:06.100
Yes our friend Reiner is the armored Titan,

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:08.466
and Bertoldt is the Colossal!

00:05:08.466 --> 00:05:10.533
So they get him and are out of there.

00:05:10.533 --> 00:05:11.800
Soon they have to stop for rest though,

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:14.966
And by the way, anyone with Titan powers can regenerate any injury.

00:05:14.966 --> 00:05:16.400
It'd be nice if we finally got some answers

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.300
on where these two came from and what's going on,

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:19.666
But they don't say nothing.

00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:21.533
They brought Ymir with them, too, though she wasn’t “with” them,

00:05:21.533 --> 00:05:22.900
And she's not saying much either.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:24.300
We do get a vague part of her story.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.266
For reasons unknown she was turned into a Titan,

00:05:26.266 --> 00:05:28.466
which was for many years a waking nightmare.

00:05:28.466 --> 00:05:31.066
But she stumbled upon Reiner and Bertholdt and Annie’s undercover crew, 

00:05:31.066 --> 00:05:32.500
and ate their fourth friend.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.900
And apparently if a normal Titan eats someone who has a Titan transformation power,

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:38.600
they turn back to human and now get that power.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:39.933
Anyway the scouts catch up to them

00:05:39.933 --> 00:05:42.333
so it's a big old chase with a bunch of normal titans following.

00:05:42.333 --> 00:05:45.866
But now Reiner's chucking other Titans at them, it turns into a whole mess.

00:05:45.866 --> 00:05:50.700
And Eren Yeager comes face to face with the Titan that ate his mother!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.900
He tries to transform, but he doesn't have the strength yet,

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:55.133
so he goes to just punch this thing,

00:05:55.133 --> 00:05:57.633
and oh! It actually works?

00:05:57.633 --> 00:05:59.066
Something unexpected has happened,

00:05:59.066 --> 00:06:03.733
For reasons unknown, Eren can now control other Titans!

00:06:03.733 --> 00:06:06.100
What is going on?!

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:08.866
Eren doesn't keep his Titan controlling power, it only worked that once.

00:06:08.866 --> 00:06:12.266
So once again, we're left with more questions than answers.

00:06:12.266 --> 00:06:15.733
So season three begins with an unresolved mystery from the start of season two...

00:06:15.733 --> 00:06:19.233
There are Titans in inside the walls!

00:06:19.233 --> 00:06:22.000
The high priest of the Wall religion seems to know something about it,

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.733
But now he dies under mysterious circumstances,

00:06:24.733 --> 00:06:26.833
smells like a government cover up.

00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:30.133
Indeed, the powers that be have decided the Scouts are getting too close to the truth.

00:06:30.133 --> 00:06:33.033
So for a while our crew has got to go into hiding as fugitives.

00:06:33.033 --> 00:06:34.933
And hunting them is an incredibly skilled fighter,

00:06:34.933 --> 00:06:36.900
It's Kenny, Kenny the Ripper.

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:39.300
He and his crew use ODM gear with guns,

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.300
specifically trained to fight other humans.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:42.966
But they're still no match for Captain Levi.

00:06:42.966 --> 00:06:46.566
Kenny himself though, is a match for Levi, in fact Levi is his nephew

00:06:46.566 --> 00:06:49.600
that he raised in the under city until one day he got bored and left.

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.933
Turns out Kenny and Levi are both Ackermans,

00:06:51.933 --> 00:06:54.100
who for a long time were the bodyguards of the King.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.233
Something in their genes make them incredibly strong fighters,

00:06:56.233 --> 00:06:58.166
which is why they're so much better than everyone else.

00:06:58.166 --> 00:07:00.900
And guess who else’s last name is Ackerman, it’s Mikasa.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.366
Yes it's not by chance she's that skilled, it's in her blood.

00:07:03.366 --> 00:07:06.500
So now the government is going to execute Commander Erwin and disband the Scouts.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.833
But the rest of the military's like, “Yeah, nah, you guys are clearly corrupt.”

00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:11.900
They have a little coup and the scouts names are cleared.

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:14.866
But Eren Yeager was captured, along with Christa - why her?

00:07:14.866 --> 00:07:16.933
Well turns out her real name is Historia Rice.

00:07:16.933 --> 00:07:20.700
She's a secret daughter of Lord Rice, who turns out, is the true royal family.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.966
So Eren's chained up in a weird crystal cavern,

00:07:22.966 --> 00:07:25.266
and we actually finally get some answers!

00:07:25.266 --> 00:07:27.466
The royal family has the power of the Founding Titan,

00:07:27.466 --> 00:07:29.733
or, “The Coordinate,” which lets them control other Titans.

00:07:29.733 --> 00:07:32.200
That's how the original King Fritz built the walls 100 years ago,

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.633
they're made out of hardened Titans.

00:07:33.633 --> 00:07:35.033
So for generations, this Founding Titan

00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:36.633
has been passed down through the royal bloodline.

00:07:36.633 --> 00:07:38.700
You inject yourself with the thing, turn into a Titan,

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:40.700
eat your ancestor, and boom, you're the new king.

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:43.966
But five years ago, Eren's father Grisha Yeager crashed the ceremony,

00:07:43.966 --> 00:07:46.333
and somehow he had the power to turn into a Titan.

00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:48.366
They had a Titan fight but Eren's dad won,

00:07:48.366 --> 00:07:50.400
and ate the Founding Titan, taking the power for himself.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.033
Then he injected young Eren, who turned into a Titan and ate his dad,

00:07:53.033 --> 00:07:55.133
and now had the power of both those Titans.

00:07:55.133 --> 00:07:57.433
“Historia, you've got to turn into a Titan, eat your friend Eren,”

00:07:57.433 --> 00:07:59.400
“and get the Founding Titan back in the royal bloodline.”

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:00.933
So that sounds nice, time to save the world,

00:08:00.933 --> 00:08:02.600
But Historia realizes the hole in the story.

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:04.633
If the royal family had this power for a hundred years,

00:08:04.633 --> 00:08:06.633
why did they never use it to stop the Titans?

00:08:06.633 --> 00:08:08.433
Well, turns out, along with the Founding Titan,

00:08:08.433 --> 00:08:10.166
Comes the memories of the original King Fritz.

00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:11.566
And whoever gets it never explains why,

00:08:11.566 --> 00:08:13.766
but is like, “Oh yeah, nah, we got to stay within the walls.”

00:08:13.766 --> 00:08:16.233
So it becomes clear her dad does not have humanity's best interest at heart,

00:08:16.233 --> 00:08:17.433
he just wants to hold on to power.

00:08:17.433 --> 00:08:19.066
And Historia is like, “Oh hell nah,”

00:08:19.066 --> 00:08:21.833
“time to break the cycle and free humanity from the God King's rule!”

00:08:21.833 --> 00:08:24.033
Now a desperate Lord Rice licks the Titan potion,

00:08:24.033 --> 00:08:25.500
which is not how you're supposed to use it.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.333
He turns into a massive Titan!

00:08:27.333 --> 00:08:28.633
Eren and friends are going to be crushed,

00:08:28.633 --> 00:08:31.200
but Eren found the bottle that gives Titans hardening power and eats it,

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.300
So boom! Yeah!

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:34.766
Now he makes a hardened Titan thing and saves them.

00:08:34.766 --> 00:08:38.100
But Lord Rice has turned into such a big Titan he can’t even walk.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:41.066
He crawls his way to the nearest village and the Scouts got to fight him.

00:08:41.066 --> 00:08:43.866
They ram some gunpowder down his throat and boom! Exploded!

00:08:43.866 --> 00:08:46.866
So Historia is crowned queen, but not bound to the will of her ancestors,

00:08:46.866 --> 00:08:47.933
and the day is saved.

00:08:47.933 --> 00:08:49.366
Now, with Eren’s new hardening power,

00:08:49.366 --> 00:08:51.266
he can theoretically patch up holes in the wall.

00:08:51.266 --> 00:08:54.700
So for the first time, humanity has a chance to patch up the holes in Shiganshina,

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.433
and take back the outer ring!

00:08:56.433 --> 00:08:59.100
The Scouts right out in force, and at first the mission goes well.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.566
But it was a trap!

00:09:00.566 --> 00:09:03.266
Behind them a whole new crop of Titans pop up,

00:09:03.266 --> 00:09:05.000
led by the Beast Titan.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.866
We briefly get to meet him, his name is Zeke,

00:09:06.866 --> 00:09:08.366
and he's Reiner and Bertoldt’s Commander.

00:09:08.366 --> 00:09:11.166
And the Beast Titan is maybe the most dangerous, he's a good baseball player...

00:09:11.166 --> 00:09:13.466
Turns rocks into weapons of mass destruction!

00:09:13.466 --> 00:09:17.166
So Commander Erwin leads a suicide charge, and almost all the Scouts are wiped out.

00:09:17.166 --> 00:09:19.600
But that bought time for Captain Levi to sneak around the back,

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.900
and oh! Takes the Beast Titan out!

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.166
But Zeke is rescued by another super weird Titan

00:09:24.166 --> 00:09:26.366
who runs around on all fours, they call the Cart Titan.

00:09:26.366 --> 00:09:29.033
Our gang blows up Reiner, but the Cart Titan’s there to rescue him too.

00:09:29.033 --> 00:09:31.766
And now it's Armin who has the genius plan to take out the Colossal Titan.

00:09:31.766 --> 00:09:34.366
He goads him into using his steam thing, but he holds on...

00:09:34.366 --> 00:09:36.000
until oh! Sacrificing himself.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.833
But Armin figured out using the steam burns away the Colossal’s muscle mass,

00:09:38.833 --> 00:09:42.066
And it bought time for Eren, back in human form, to sneak up behind,

00:09:42.066 --> 00:09:43.966
and oh! Get Bertholdt!

00:09:43.966 --> 00:09:46.133
Lord Rice had one more Titan creating injection,

00:09:46.133 --> 00:09:48.366
so if the Scouts can capture one of the transforming Titans alive,

00:09:48.366 --> 00:09:49.633
they can take that power.

00:09:49.633 --> 00:09:51.433
And Armin is still alive, just barely.

00:09:51.433 --> 00:09:53.533
It's like, “Hey, give him the Titan injection so it’ll heal him”

00:09:53.533 --> 00:09:55.100
“and he can eat Bertholdt, get the Colossal.”

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:57.433
But turns out Commander Erwin is also barely alive,

00:09:57.433 --> 00:09:59.500
And Levi's got to choose which one to save.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.133
But with his last breath, Commander Erwin’s like,

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:02.533
“Nah, let me die, save the kid.”

00:10:02.533 --> 00:10:05.000
And so it's Armin who's turned into a Titan,

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.100
eats Bertholdt, and now has the power of the Colossal.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.533
And so it's an epic victory for humanity,

00:10:10.533 --> 00:10:12.766
they finally reclaimed their outer ring!

00:10:12.766 --> 00:10:15.200
But we still have no idea what's really going on,

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.366
but now that they can get to Eren's old house in Shiganshina,

00:10:17.366 --> 00:10:20.633
it's finally time to find out what's in that cellar!

00:10:20.633 --> 00:10:23.400
The mysterious key opens a secret drawer, which has books in it.

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:26.633
A book with a photograph of Eren's father and another family.

00:10:26.633 --> 00:10:29.833
This is weird because our people don't have photograph technology.

00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:32.033
Turns out they're not the last humans on Earth,

00:10:32.033 --> 00:10:33.866
there's a whole world out there!

00:10:33.866 --> 00:10:37.066
Yes, our walled city is just on one little island.

00:10:37.066 --> 00:10:38.866
They’re next to the Empire of Marley,

00:10:38.866 --> 00:10:40.866
which is at like early 1900s technology.

00:10:40.866 --> 00:10:43.400
That's where Eren's father is from, but he’s an Eldian,

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:45.333
a race that is horribly discriminated against,

00:10:45.333 --> 00:10:47.000
forced to wear armbands and live in ghettos.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.600
The official story goes that Queen Ymir of the Eldians

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:51.933
made a deal with the devil to get Titan powers.

00:10:51.933 --> 00:10:55.600
And the old Eldian Empire used the power of the Nine Titans that people can turn into

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:57.900
to dominate the world, and they were awful and evil.

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.533
But eventually there was a big war where Marley got

00:10:59.533 --> 00:11:01.233
eight of the nine Titans and defeated Eldia.

00:11:01.233 --> 00:11:03.300
So the Eldian King Fritz fled with most of his people

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.300
to the island of Paradis, “Paradise.”

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:07.333
Where he used the power of the Founding Titan to build the walls,

00:11:07.333 --> 00:11:09.600
and erase his people’s memories so they could live in peace.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.133
But many Eldians were left behind in Marley,

00:11:11.133 --> 00:11:13.166
where now they're treated terribly because of their “devil blood.”

00:11:13.166 --> 00:11:15.633
But when Grisha Yeager’s little sister is killed by Marleyan police,

00:11:15.633 --> 00:11:18.100
he's like, “Oh, hell nah! We Eldians deserve better!”

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:20.400
He grows up and joins the underground Eldian resistance.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.800
Now it's here Grisha meets his first wife,

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:24.733
who is a descendant of the royal bloodline that was left behind.

00:11:24.733 --> 00:11:27.233
So they have a dream, if they can take back the power of the founding Titan,

00:11:27.233 --> 00:11:30.366
they can use it to unleash the million Titans that make up the walls,

00:11:30.366 --> 00:11:32.033
and stomp Marley to dust!

00:11:32.033 --> 00:11:34.833
And the Eldian of royal blood who would wield it is their son Zeke!

00:11:34.833 --> 00:11:37.100
Yes, the Beast Titan is Eren's half brother.

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:38.566
And Marley recruits Eldians into their army

00:11:38.566 --> 00:11:40.933
because they're the only ones that can use the power of the Titans.

00:11:40.933 --> 00:11:42.566
That’s who Reiner and Bertholdt and Annie were,

00:11:42.566 --> 00:11:44.400
Eldian warriors fighting for Marley.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:47.033
So Dr. Grisha Yeager was indoctrinating his young son Zeke,

00:11:47.033 --> 00:11:48.433
“You have to pretend to be loyal to Marley,”

00:11:48.433 --> 00:11:50.333
“so you can become one of the Eldian Titan warriors.”

00:11:50.333 --> 00:11:52.900
“But secretly you have to be anti- Marley, steal the Founding Titan,”

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.566
“and use it to lead the Eldian revolution.”

00:11:54.566 --> 00:11:55.966
This was too much pressure for young Zeke,

00:11:55.966 --> 00:11:58.566
and he ended up turning his parents in... whoops.

00:11:58.566 --> 00:12:02.066
Criminal Eldians are taking to Paradis, where they're turned into Titans.

00:12:02.066 --> 00:12:04.800
So that's where the Titans are coming from, it’s a punishment for them,

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:07.466
and they serve as guards to keep the island Eldians inside their walls.

00:12:07.466 --> 00:12:09.500
But Grisha Yeager is saved by his guard,

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.033
who turns out is a secret Eldian in the resistance too.

00:12:12.033 --> 00:12:13.400
And somehow, through unknown means,

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:15.433
he has the power of one of the nine Titans.

00:12:15.433 --> 00:12:18.066
It's the one Eren gets, the Attack Titan!

00:12:18.066 --> 00:12:21.033
He's like, “Hey man, I have the same basic plan as you, but I can't do it myself.”

00:12:21.033 --> 00:12:22.400
Anyone who gets one of the nine Titans

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.133
only lives for 13 years, and my time's almost up.

00:12:25.133 --> 00:12:27.033
You got to take this one from me, infiltrate the walls,

00:12:27.033 --> 00:12:29.000
steal the Founding Titan, and save all Eldians.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.533
And so he did, that's the story we know,

00:12:30.533 --> 00:12:31.700
and passed it on to his son, Eren.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.300
But wait a sec, the Founding Titan only works

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:34.800
if you have royal blood, which Eren doesn't.

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.466
But Erin figures out why it worked that one time

00:12:36.466 --> 00:12:37.733
when he touched this specific Titan...

00:12:37.733 --> 00:12:41.433
Because that Titan was his dad's first wife who had the royal blood.

00:12:41.433 --> 00:12:45.366
So now we finally know - mostly - what is going on.

00:12:45.366 --> 00:12:47.333
And so relatively quickly, our humans

00:12:47.333 --> 00:12:50.466
finally eradicate all the Titans on their island...

00:12:50.466 --> 00:12:52.400
They are finally free!

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:53.766
Except, they're kind of not, though,

00:12:53.766 --> 00:12:55.900
because right across the sea is an entire world of people

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:57.966
that think they're devils and want to kill them...

00:12:57.966 --> 00:12:58.966
Kind of a bummer.

00:12:58.966 --> 00:13:02.233
And so, season four begins four years later over in Marley.

00:13:02.233 --> 00:13:03.800
We follow a new bunch of kids,

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:06.266
they’re the top Eldian warrior candidates to inherit one of the Titans.

00:13:06.266 --> 00:13:08.933
The main ones are confident girl Gabi, and her friend Falco.

00:13:08.933 --> 00:13:11.733
Now Marley's at war with someone and we get to see their Titans in action.

00:13:11.733 --> 00:13:13.333
By the way, Ymir was executed,

00:13:13.333 --> 00:13:16.466
They gave her Titan to a new guy, its proper name is the Jaw Titan.

00:13:16.466 --> 00:13:19.133
Anyway as we get to know these people, we see they really aren't bad.

00:13:19.133 --> 00:13:22.300
And Reiner also, who we've thought of as an enemy, but is a decent guy.

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:24.266
He and his crew thought they were making their country proud

00:13:24.266 --> 00:13:27.666
as they were shipped off as kids on an undercover genocide mission.

00:13:27.666 --> 00:13:30.633
Anyway now, with the recent war won, it's time to focus on Paradis again.

00:13:30.633 --> 00:13:31.600
They have a big event to announce

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.600
they're finally going to go wipe out those Eldian devils.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.233
But one of them is closer than they think...

00:13:35.233 --> 00:13:37.933
It's long haired adult Eren Yeager!

00:13:37.933 --> 00:13:39.900
Oh! Titan attack!

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:43.066
Yes a bunch of Scouts are here, ready to fight in the modern world.

00:13:43.066 --> 00:13:45.333
It's a massive fight, all the Marley Titans join in,

00:13:45.333 --> 00:13:48.233
but our crew with their ODM gear are deadly.

00:13:48.233 --> 00:13:50.500
But now Mikasa is like, “Eren, what have you done?”

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.566
“You just killed thousands of civilians.”

00:13:52.566 --> 00:13:55.366
And our new kid, Gabi, having seen a bunch of her friends die,

00:13:55.366 --> 00:13:58.666
swears vengeance! Just like Eren did all those years ago.

00:13:58.666 --> 00:14:00.133
Our crew escapes on their new airship,

00:14:00.133 --> 00:14:01.733
but Gabi's not letting them get away.

00:14:01.733 --> 00:14:05.100
She and Falco get aboard and shoots the first person she sees...

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:07.300
Which is-- no! Not Sasha!

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:09.433
She was so nice, just loved to eat.

00:14:09.433 --> 00:14:11.133
Going back a few years to see how we got here,

00:14:11.133 --> 00:14:13.066
our people captured one of the Marleyan scout ships.

00:14:13.066 --> 00:14:14.400
The tall girl in command here is like,

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:17.666
“Hey, we're part of the Eldian resistance against Marley, we want to be friends.”

00:14:17.666 --> 00:14:19.566
So they helped our wall people get modern technology

00:14:19.566 --> 00:14:20.933
and meet some allies out in the world.

00:14:20.933 --> 00:14:23.066
This country was allies with the old Eldian Empire,

00:14:23.066 --> 00:14:25.033
and turns out their queen went behind the walls, too.

00:14:25.033 --> 00:14:27.766
And it's Mikasa’s ancestor, so she's a princess.

00:14:27.766 --> 00:14:30.466
And speaking of princesses, in case it matters, Historia is pregnant.

00:14:30.466 --> 00:14:33.366
At the time they had high hopes that they would be able to come out to the world,

00:14:33.366 --> 00:14:36.966
like, “Hey, we are not devils, we don't want to conquer you, please, let's all live in peace.”

00:14:36.966 --> 00:14:40.000
But our crew soon discovered that the world hated them more than they even thought,

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.700
And that's when Aaron left them and went on his own secret plan,

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:44.800
to launch the first strike attack on Marley.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.433
Most of the military, including Eren's friends,

00:14:46.433 --> 00:14:48.266
all think this attack was a bad idea.

00:14:48.266 --> 00:14:50.400
But there's a lot of them who think that Eren had the right of it,

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:53.000
and are ready to conquer the world as the new Eldian Empire.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.633
And soon Aaron breaks himself out of prison

00:14:54.633 --> 00:14:56.500
to lead this group called the Yeagerists.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:59.833
And Eren Yeager has grown up from an annoying, angry, yelling kid

00:14:59.833 --> 00:15:02.866
to a bad ass, stone cold, rebel leader!

00:15:02.866 --> 00:15:06.200
Now back in the city, Marleyan airships are here for their counterattack.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:08.200
And leading the assault is our old friend Reiner,

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.100
who is the armored Titan,

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.400
And he and Eren have an epic rematch!

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.633
The Beast Titan joins the battle,

00:15:13.633 --> 00:15:15.566
but remember, he's fighting against Marley now.

00:15:15.566 --> 00:15:18.433
Zeke's real goal is to touch Eren, uniting the Founding Titan

00:15:18.433 --> 00:15:20.833
with a member of Royal Blood, they can actually use its power.

00:15:20.833 --> 00:15:22.766
So Marley’s main goal is not to let that happen,

00:15:22.766 --> 00:15:24.500
they blast Zeke to take him out.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.733
But he’s not dead, so now he has to play his trump card...

00:15:26.733 --> 00:15:29.166
We learned that it’s Zeke’s spinal fluid, that if Eldians ingest it, 

00:15:29.166 --> 00:15:31.600
he can turn them into Titans, somewhat under his control.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:35.200
Turns out the wine his friends brought from Mali were spiked with his juices.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:37.433
He screams, transforming all the Paradis Eldians

00:15:37.433 --> 00:15:39.300
that drank the wine spiked with the spinal fluid

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:40.966
into Titans!

00:15:40.966 --> 00:15:42.666
Falco accidentally drank some of the wine,

00:15:42.666 --> 00:15:45.700
So he's a Titan too now, and rushes over to attack Reiner.

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:48.133
But wait who's this come to sacrifice himself to save Reiner,

00:15:48.133 --> 00:15:50.700
it's their other friend who has the Jaw Titan.

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.900
And oh! Now Falco eats him,

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.566
got the power of the Jaw.

00:15:54.566 --> 00:15:57.433
So now Reiner continues to beat up Eren, but Eren Yeager pulls a trick.

00:15:57.433 --> 00:16:01.100
He hardens to trap Reiner there, then leaves his body and makes a run for it...

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:04.333
because Zeke is still alive, and he's going to touch him!

00:16:04.333 --> 00:16:07.900
But now who’s this? It's little Gabi with a sniper rifle!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:12.033
Boom! Oh! She blows Eren’s head clean off!

00:16:12.033 --> 00:16:14.900
But, if there's one thing we know about Zeke, he loves playing baseball...

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:17.133
and he makes the diving catch!

00:16:17.133 --> 00:16:20.666
And Eren’s brain was just alive enough, they've successfully done it.

00:16:20.666 --> 00:16:25.266
They are in the Coordinate of all Eldians, with their founder, Ymir.

00:16:25.266 --> 00:16:27.233
So Zeke, who witnessed all the Eldian suffering,

00:16:27.233 --> 00:16:29.166
doesn't agree with his dad that they should rise up.

00:16:29.166 --> 00:16:31.733
He thinks it would be best if they just disappeared.

00:16:31.733 --> 00:16:33.833
Apparently his real plan is to take the Founding Titan,

00:16:33.833 --> 00:16:35.600
and use it to sterilize all Eldians,

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:38.500
so they, and Titans, will disappear from the Earth.

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:39.733
Now at first Zeke is chained up,

00:16:39.733 --> 00:16:41.266
It's like “Eren, actually you have the power here.”

00:16:41.266 --> 00:16:42.800
And Eren is like, “Well, sike bro!”

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.766
“I'm not doing your plan, I'm doing my own plan!”

00:16:44.766 --> 00:16:47.066
But now Zeke is like, “Yo, double sike!”

00:16:47.066 --> 00:16:49.333
“I was just pretending to not have power here”

00:16:49.333 --> 00:16:51.200
“so you would reveal your true intentions.”

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.500
Long story short, they go on a journey

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:54.266
through the memories of their father, Grisha Yeager.

00:16:54.266 --> 00:16:55.966
And turns out he didn't go through with his plan

00:16:55.966 --> 00:16:57.766
to kill the royal family and steal the Founding Titan,

00:16:57.766 --> 00:16:59.766
because, you know, it would involve massacring these kids.

00:16:59.766 --> 00:17:03.266
But then Eren Yeager starts talking to his father, who can hear him! 

00:17:03.266 --> 00:17:06.133
It's like, “What's up Dad, I'm the spirit of your son
from the future,”

00:17:06.133 --> 00:17:08.866
“here to tell you, you got to go through with it... Trust me.”

00:17:08.866 --> 00:17:10.900
So somehow it was Eren Yeager himself

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:13.733
who started this whole adventure to get to this present moment,

00:17:13.733 --> 00:17:15.733
Because now it's like, “Triple sike, bro!”

00:17:15.733 --> 00:17:18.433
“I actually DO somehow have the power here!”

00:17:18.433 --> 00:17:20.533
So now Zeke tells Ymir to sterilize all the Eldians,

00:17:20.533 --> 00:17:21.966
and Eren goes over to stop her.

00:17:21.966 --> 00:17:24.433
And this whole series it’s been a mystery, who actually was Ymir

00:17:24.433 --> 00:17:26.100
and how did she end up with the Titan power?

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.866
Turns out Ymir wasn't Eldian herself, she was a slave of the Eldians,

00:17:28.866 --> 00:17:30.366
who were, confirmed, terrible people.

00:17:30.366 --> 00:17:33.133
Somehow she fell into this water with a weird jellyfish vertebrate thing, 

00:17:33.133 --> 00:17:35.700
that oh! Turned her in to the first Titan.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.233
But Ymir spent her whole life as a slave,

00:17:37.233 --> 00:17:39.300
she only knew obedience to the Eldian King Fritz,

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:42.900
and so used her Titan powers to join his army and help conquer the world.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:46.133
In fact, she had King Fritz’s children, and one day sacrificed herself to save him.

00:17:46.133 --> 00:17:48.266
To keep the Titan power, they had her children eat her,

00:17:48.266 --> 00:17:50.633
and that's how we got the Nine Titans.

00:17:50.633 --> 00:17:53.166
So now Aaron grabs her like, “Yo, it's time to stop being a slave,”

00:17:53.166 --> 00:17:54.233
“it's time for you to fight back!”

00:17:54.233 --> 00:17:56.133
And she's like, “You know what, bro? You're right.”

00:17:56.133 --> 00:17:59.533
So somehow she passes the Founding Titan Power to Eren!

00:17:59.533 --> 00:18:01.666
And now we realize Eren's true plan

00:18:01.666 --> 00:18:04.133
is not to threaten the Rumbling to keep Marley away...

00:18:04.133 --> 00:18:06.766
But to unleash it right now!

00:18:06.766 --> 00:18:10.033
Yes, the walls are coming down!

00:18:10.033 --> 00:18:13.566
A million Colossal Titans headed to the mainland,

00:18:13.566 --> 00:18:16.033
the Rumbling is here!

00:18:16.033 --> 00:18:19.133
Eren psychically talks to all the Eldians, like, “Hey what's up guys.”

00:18:19.133 --> 00:18:21.000
It's like, “Look, the outside world hates us,”

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:22.700
“and that's just not going to change.”

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:26.033
“The only way my home, the island of Paradis, can ever really be safe...”

00:18:26.033 --> 00:18:30.366
“is if we wipe out every person on the planet.”

00:18:30.366 --> 00:18:33.166
and yeah, I mean, that's obviously awful.

00:18:33.166 --> 00:18:36.066
but it's rough because, he's kind of right?

00:18:36.066 --> 00:18:40.366
So the Rumbling is happening, and doesn't look like anyone can stop it.

00:18:40.366 --> 00:18:42.700
The Yeagerists led a coup to take over Paradis,

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:44.266
they’re led by this red haired guy, Floch.

00:18:44.266 --> 00:18:46.300
But unfortunately, he's got kind of a dictator vibe,

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:47.800
and executes anyone not on his side.

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:49.133
This leaves any Marleyan survivors,

00:18:49.133 --> 00:18:50.966
like Pieck, the Cart Titan, as enemies of the state.

00:18:50.966 --> 00:18:52.933
And also enemies of the state are Commander Hanje,

00:18:52.933 --> 00:18:54.933
and an injured but alive Captain Levi.

00:18:54.933 --> 00:18:57.400
It's like, “Yo, we're not with the Yeagerists, let’s be allies.”

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:59.466
And all of Eren's friends are in on the plan.

00:18:59.466 --> 00:19:02.400
And they recruit another old friend... It’s Annie!

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:03.666
Yeah when Eren took down the walls,

00:19:03.666 --> 00:19:06.800
he undid all hardened Titans, including her shell.

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:09.366
So for almost the whole series she's been sitting there in the basement,

00:19:09.366 --> 00:19:11.400
but now Annie is back!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:14.700
And so, all our main characters are on the same side.

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:16.366
it's been complicated, as everyone's had 

00:19:16.366 --> 00:19:18.466
different motivations  to fight at different times.

00:19:18.466 --> 00:19:19.366
But now they all agree,

00:19:19.366 --> 00:19:22.266
killing everyone in the world is not the right move.

00:19:22.266 --> 00:19:23.866
They got to stop Eren.

00:19:23.866 --> 00:19:27.166
But Eren has a head start, the Rumbling Titans have made it to Marley.

00:19:27.166 --> 00:19:28.733
But our crew has a plan to catch up to him,

00:19:28.733 --> 00:19:31.666
with the Azumabito’s “flying boat,” which is... a plane.

00:19:31.666 --> 00:19:33.833
So it's a big fight at the port against the Yeagerists,

00:19:33.833 --> 00:19:36.600
which is tragic because many of them were our former friends.

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:39.633
The Yeagerist leader Floch is ready to stop them, but oh, he’s shot!

00:19:39.633 --> 00:19:42.366
He was the hero in his own story, but not in this one.

00:19:42.366 --> 00:19:45.033
As they use the boat to tow the plane, Annie and Armin start talking.

00:19:45.033 --> 00:19:47.066
Turns out he visited her all the time she was frozen.

00:19:47.066 --> 00:19:49.466
Yes Armin has a crush on Annie, and she thinks that's sweet,

00:19:49.466 --> 00:19:51.466
so we have a last minute romance blooming.

00:19:51.466 --> 00:19:53.700
What about a romance between Mikasa and Eren?

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:56.300
It's always been, are they just friends? We’ll see...

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:58.100
Now on Marley they get the plane ready to fly,

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:01.266
But Floch survived and stowed away, oh! Takes some last shots!

00:20:01.266 --> 00:20:02.900
Now it's going to take some more time to repair,

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:05.166
but they're out of time, the Rumbling is here! 

00:20:05.166 --> 00:20:07.133
And so it's Hanje who's going to buy them time.

00:20:07.133 --> 00:20:09.933
And she flies off for an epic last stand!

00:20:09.933 --> 00:20:11.700
The Colossal Titans, remember, are really hot,

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.433
so she goes out in a literal blaze of glory.

00:20:14.433 --> 00:20:15.800
The plane took off just in time,

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:17.933
and now it's time to strategize, “How do we stop Eren?”

00:20:17.933 --> 00:20:20.133
Armin and Mikasa hope they can talk some sense into Eren,

00:20:20.133 --> 00:20:22.500
and in fact Eren brings them in for a psychic convo.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:24.733
And we finally get some insight into what Eren's thinking,

00:20:24.733 --> 00:20:27.500
turns out he feels real bad about killing the whole world.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.333
But he still believes it's the right thing to do,

00:20:29.333 --> 00:20:31.066
and so he's going through with this.

00:20:31.066 --> 00:20:33.166
“The only way to stop me, you'll have to kill me.”

00:20:33.166 --> 00:20:36.466
And so at an airbase, Marleyans and Eldians are united in purpose,

00:20:36.466 --> 00:20:39.333
as they send out their blimps to make a last stand.

00:20:39.333 --> 00:20:43.666
But Eren’s new Titan body is a gigantic, skeletal, creepy thing!

00:20:43.666 --> 00:20:45.700
And Zeke's Beast Titan is under his control,

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:48.200
and so real quick, the blimps are destroyed.

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:50.766
And so our crew is humanity's last hope.

00:20:50.766 --> 00:20:53.700
They fly in on the plane, jump out of there!

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:56.800
All our main characters here for one last ride!

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:58.266
Reiner goes straight for the Beast Titan,

00:20:58.266 --> 00:21:00.066
there's the hope that without Zeke's royal blood,

00:21:00.066 --> 00:21:01.900
Eren won't be able to control the Founding Titan.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:04.466
As the rest of them prepare to fight their friend Eren Yeager,

00:21:04.466 --> 00:21:07.333
how will this epic saga come to an end?

00:21:07.333 --> 00:21:11.533
Find out in Attack on Titan, the final, final(?), part.

00:21:12.366 --> 00:21:14.600
If you liked this recap, hit that Subscribe button,

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:17.300
for more of the best recaps of TV and movies.

